  "translation": "Gomme ka go boela ga selemo kgoši Nebukadnetsare a romela, gomme a mo isa Babele, le didirišwa tša sekgahla tša ntlo ya Yahwe; gomme a dira ⟨את⟩ Tsidkiya mokgwenetho wa gagwe go ba kgoši go Juda le Yerushalayime.",
